  "question": {
    "text": "The energy of an electron in first Bohr's orbit of H atom is <math> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>eV</mtext><mtext>.</mtext></mrow> </math> The energy value of electron in the first excited state of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>Li</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>2+</mtext></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math> is :",
